{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "The app reads `config.ini` with configparser. Migrate it to `config.toml` read with\nthe standard library `tomllib`. Keep the same sections and keys, keep numeric values\nnumeric (ints and floats, not strings), keep booleans as booleans, and keep the\npublic function `load_config(path)` returning the same nested dict shape it does\ntoday, but with proper types. Delete `config.ini` when done. Run the tests."}, "timestamp": "2026-10-09T15:45:18.219Z"}
